From: Navi
Subject: [PATCH] navi: tag is_tunnel on CoMaps turns JSON

Count contiguous highway/*/tunnel runs on MWM routes by looking up feature
types behind each route segment (RoutingOptions has no Tunnel bit).

---
--- a/libs/routing/routes_builder/routes_builder.cpp
+++ b/libs/routing/routes_builder/routes_builder.cpp
@@ -10,8 +10,12 @@
